theorem k215BinaryPairCleanAt2035 (u t w c a b v: nat):
 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2046 (k215PVector u t (snd w) c a b (fst w) 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2056 (k215PVector u 0 (snd w) c a b 0 (fst w, t) v)) $ =
