pub theorem k215BinaryConstructor2035 (u t w c a b v: nat):
 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2035 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2062 (k215PVector u (kImp (fst w) t) (snd w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215BinaryUnpairAt2035) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215BinaryRestoreStackAt2035) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215BinaryPairCleanAt2035) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215BinaryFourAt2035) k215BinaryTagAllAt2035))));

